        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>Logistics providers, ports and manufacturers need real-time visibility into where assets are, what condition they are in, and whether their provenance can be verified. This requires connected sensors, reliable network coverage across transit routes and platforms that aggregate data.</p>
          <p>Blockchain technology offers immutable provenance records for high-value goods, pharmaceuticals and food supply chains. Operators need infrastructure that combines IoT data collection with distributed ledger verification to build trust with customers and regulators.</p>
